# Hyperlocal Headings

Use Parallel Search before inventing ranking claims. Formulas live in `lib/heading-copy.ts` (Parallel Search, 2026-08-24).

## Pattern
- **H1**: `{Place/Service} Homes for Sale` plus `Dr. Jan Duffy, REALTOR®` if the title is not already branded.
- **H2**: Buy/sell/market in that place + ZIP (89144, 89138, 89135) + Dr. Jan Duffy.
- **H3**: Named community, ZIP, or service — not "Why Choose Us" or "Community Highlights".
- One H1 per page. No keyword stuffing. Fair Housing: no "family-friendly", "good schools", "safe neighborhood".

## Do not
- Lead with "Berkshire Hathaway HomeServices {Place}" as the H1 (brokerage in body/NAP, not the ranking title).
- Use generic CTAs ("Ready for Your Next Chapter?") as the only H1.
